WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.293
Watch and read: Choose a describing word for the mango.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.573
The answer is: yellow. A describing word tells us more about an object.

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:13.119
Watch and read: The ball is on the desk. Which word shows position?

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:17.769
The answer is: on. A preposition tells us where something is.
